<title>USA: TENNIS-U.S. TEAM LEADS THE NETHERLANDS 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. TEAM LEADS THE NETHERLANDS 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, California 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United</p>
<p>States led the Netherlands 2-0 after the opening singles</p>
<p>matches in their Davis Cup quarter-final tie on Friday:</p>
<p>Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 6-4 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 4-6 4-6</p>
<p>6-1 7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
</text>
